## Live runner (October 2026)

**Ops only for the poll loop. Frozen v8.7 and tagged OOS v8.8 are not modified. v8.10 on this branch also has the 90-minute sw1–sw2 gate.**

- Close loop: 1-minute bar close → wait 1s → incremental pull of that close → each live process scores → Slack only on a new identity.
- Incremental snapshot reuses the on-disk 36h cache (5-minute overlap) instead of re-pulling 36h every poll.
- Live `retrieveBars` timeout is 20s (historical pull stays 30s).
- Catch-up re-poll if a poll overruns the next minute. Extra polls do not post “no alert” to Slack.

